+//  - setFrameProjection(): GameRenderer hands over the exact (bobbed, nausea-skewed) projection of the frame; render()
+//    builds a TerrainFrustum from it and the terrain model-view, and forgets it at the end of the frame.
+//  - extractSectionDrawGroups(): S2 drops section-layers whose bounds miss the exact frustum; S1 emits, on the MDI
+//    path, one record per merged run of facing buckets that can face the eye (TerrainRuns); S1b splits records at
+//    16383 quads for the 16-bit terrain quad index buffer; S0 counters (TerrainStats) when enabled.
+//  - prepareChunkRenders(Indirect)(): with S1b the terrain draws use the dedicated 16-bit quad index buffer (owned
+//    here, closed in close()) and no longer grow the shared sequential quad buffer.
+//  - prepareTranslucents(): passes the frame projection to the cloud renderer (S7). endFrame(): TerrainStats.endFrame().
+//  - prepareChunkRendersIndirect(): with TerrainToggles.fastDrawList (S4, render-thread CPU) the list is built by
